@startuml Real-Time Progress Monitoring
!theme plain

title Real-Time Progress Monitoring Architecture

actor User
participant "Java UI\n(AITechniquePanel)" as UI
participant "SwingWorker\n(Background Thread)" as Worker
participant "Python Process\n(configurable_main.py)" as Python
participant "Progress Bars\n(EDT)" as EDT

User -> UI: Click "Run" button
activate UI

UI -> Worker: Start SwingWorker
activate Worker
note right: SwingWorker<Void, String>\n• doInBackground()\n• process(chunks)\n• done()

Worker -> Python: Execute Python script
activate Python

group Progress Logging
    Python -> Python: log_progress(0, "Starting...")
    Python --> Worker: stdout: [PROGRESS:overall:0:Starting...]
    Worker -> EDT: publish("PROGRESS...")
    activate EDT
    EDT -> UI: Update runProgressBar(0%)
    EDT -> UI: Update runStatusLabel("Starting...")
    EDT --> Worker: UI updated
    deactivate EDT
    
    Python -> Python: log_progress(10, "Loading data...")
    Python --> Worker: stdout: [PROGRESS:overall:10:Loading data...]
    Worker -> EDT: publish("PROGRESS...")
    activate EDT
    EDT -> UI: Update runProgressBar(10%)
    EDT -> UI: Update runStatusLabel("Loading data...")
    EDT -> UI: Reset taskProgressBar(0%)
    EDT --> Worker: UI updated
    deactivate EDT
end

group Model Training Progress
    Python -> Python: log_progress(50, "Training models...")
    Python --> Worker: stdout: [PROGRESS:overall:50:Training models...]
    Worker -> EDT: publish("PROGRESS...")
    activate EDT
    EDT -> UI: Update runProgressBar(50%)
    EDT -> UI: Update runStatusLabel("Training models...")
    EDT --> Worker: UI updated
    deactivate EDT
    
    Python -> Python: log_task("RandomForest", 0, "Training...")
    Python --> Worker: stdout: [TASK:RandomForest:0:Training...]
    Worker -> EDT: publish("TASK...")
    activate EDT
    EDT -> UI: Update taskProgressBar(0%)
    EDT -> UI: Update taskStatusLabel("RandomForest")
    EDT --> Worker: UI updated
    deactivate EDT
    
    Python -> Python: log_task("RandomForest", 100, "Complete")
    Python --> Worker: stdout: [TASK:RandomForest:100:Complete]
    Worker -> EDT: publish("TASK...")
    activate EDT
    EDT -> UI: Update taskProgressBar(100%)
    EDT --> Worker: UI updated
    deactivate EDT
end

group Completion
    Python -> Python: log_progress(100, "Experiment complete!")
    Python --> Worker: stdout: [PROGRESS:overall:100:Experiment complete!]
    Worker -> EDT: publish("PROGRESS...")
    activate EDT
    EDT -> UI: Update runProgressBar(100%)
    EDT -> UI: Update runStatusLabel("Complete")
    EDT --> Worker: UI updated
    deactivate EDT
    
    Python --> Worker: Process exits
    deactivate Python
    
    Worker -> EDT: done() - Update PredictionPanel
    activate EDT
    EDT -> UI: Refresh reports list
    EDT --> Worker: Complete
    deactivate EDT
    
    Worker --> UI: Finished
    deactivate Worker
end

User <-- UI: Show completion message
deactivate UI

legend right
    |= Component |= Responsibility |
    | Python | Emit structured log markers |
    | SwingWorker | Stream output, parse logs |
    | EDT | Update UI components safely |
    | Progress Bars | Display real-time feedback |
endlegend

note over Python
    **Log Format:**
    [PROGRESS:overall:percent:message]
    [TASK:model_name:percent:message]
end note

note over Worker
    **Parsing Logic:**
    • Extracts percent and message
    • Publishes to EDT via process()
    • Non-blocking UI updates
end note

note over UI
    **Dual Progress Display:**
    ├─ Overall: Workflow stages (0-100%)
    └─ Task: Per-model progress (0-100%)
end note

@enduml
